        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare disorder of purine metabolism characterized by multiple congenital anomalies/dysmorphic features including craniofacial dysmorphism especially of the midface with flat face low set ears nasal hypoplasia low nasal bridge choanal atresia/stenosis and hypertelorism. Other malformations include esophageal atresia with or without treacheoesophageal fistula as well as malformations of ribs lungs vertebrae legs toes and fingers."
        },
